    "Description": "This is a kernel live patch module which can be loaded by the kpatch command line utility to modify the code of a running kernel.  This patch module is targeted for kernel-4.18.0-553.16.1.el8_10.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* kernel: net/tipc: fix slab-use-after-free Read in tipc_aead_encrypt_done (CVE-2025-38052)\n\n* kernel: posix-cpu-timers: fix race between handle_posix_cpu_timers() and posix_cpu_timer_del() (CVE-2025-38352)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
